cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FCS Automated Clustering: FlowSOM and UMAP pipeline for high-dimensional flow cytometry"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hames"
    given-names: "Gérald"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-0505-9936"
    affiliation: "deDUuve Institute, UCLouvain"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ggfromBelgium/FCS_Automated_Clustering"
abstract: >
  R pipeline for automated flow cytometry data analysis: interactive gating,
  FlowSOM clustering with robust cluster-number selection (bootstrap,
  consensus), UMAP visualisation, AI-assisted cluster annotation, and
  comparative analysis across conditions.
keywords:
  - flow cytometry
  - FlowSOM
  - UMAP
  - clustering
  - immunology
